Writes
- Write tools change the user's records when called, after the client's approval; equori asks for no other confirmation.
- Make one call per change the user asked for. Never make a change the user did not ask for.
- A token with the read scope lists no write tool.
- For a change the request implies, describe it in the answer with its evidence and make it only after the user agrees.

Help
- For how-to questions, concepts and screens, call get_help with the closest topic. The screen paths get_help returns are relative to the address of the MCP endpoint without /mcp: for the endpoint https://host/mcp, the path /cards is https://host/cards.
{{- end}}
